{
  "component": "p13",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "I SAID I COULD BRING EVERYONE TOGETHER. I SHOULD\nHAVE SPECIFIED A DOORWAY.",
      "record_id": "P13.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU DID. THE SAME ONE.",
      "record_id": "P13.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE LOADS. THREE OPENINGS. USE THE CUES.",
      "record_id": "P13.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "EACH CUE SHOWS THE LOAD, ITS ROUTE AND ANY BLOCKED\nLANE BEFORE WE MOVE. NOBODY GOES UNTIL WE CHOOSE.\nI CAN TAKE A BREATH WITHOUT MISSING DINNER.",
      "record_id": "P13.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 6,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "HOUSE DOORWAY",
      "record_id": "P13.LABEL.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 8,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "KITCHEN HATCH",
      "record_id": "P13.LABEL.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 9,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SIDE GATE",
      "record_id": "P13.LABEL.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 10,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE. PEOPLE: HOUSE DOORWAY, THEN REAR ARCH.\nLIDDED POT: KITCHEN HATCH TO BUFFET. KEEP THE\nGUEST LANE CLEAR.",
      "record_id": "P13.READ.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 12,
      "header_entry": 11,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOW. FOLDED DISPLAY ON HANDCART: SIDE GATE TO\nDISPLAY ALCOVE. GATE HELD ON ITS PEG. REVEAL AFTER\nDINNER, WHEN RITA IS READY.",
      "record_id": "P13.READ.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 13,
      "header_entry": 11,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "TOAST. PLEDGE BOARD: HOUSE DOORWAY AFTER THE GUEST\nQUEUE CLEARS. CALL ATTENTION WITH THE MICROPHONE,\nTHEN PULL THE TOAST CUE.",
      "record_id": "P13.READ.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 14,
      "header_entry": 11,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "GUEST-PROGRAM CARD",
      "record_id": "P13.INVENTORY.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 15,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO GREETS AT THE FRONT DOOR. GUESTS USE THE\nLIVING-ROOM REAR ARCH TO REACH THEIR COURTYARD\nPLACES. ONCE THE QUEUE IS CLEAR, MILO TAKES HIS",
      "record_id": "P13.READ.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 16,
      "header_entry": 15,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "PLACE. SERVE, SHOW, TOAST.",
      "record_id": "P13.READ.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 17,
      "header_entry": 15,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "BLANK PLEDGE BOARD",
      "record_id": "P13.INVENTORY.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 18,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "EIGHT PLACES FOR EIGHT ACTUAL COMMITMENTS. I'VE\nNEVER SEEN A BLANK BOARD LOOK SO MUCH LIKE\nFRANKIE.",
      "record_id": "P13.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "PLEASE GREET AT THE FRONT DOOR. SEND EVERYONE\nTHROUGH THE REAR ARCH. THEN JOIN US.",
      "record_id": "P13.CHOICE.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 20,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "FRONT DOOR, LIVING ROOM, REAR ARCH. EVERYONE TO\nTHEIR COURTYARD PLACES, THEN I SIT DOWN.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 21,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "NO LITTLE SPEECH IN THE DOORWAY.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "MAY I SAY \"THIS WAY\"? I'VE GOT TO LET SOME OF IT\nOUT.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 24,
      "header_entry": 21,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THE LIDDED POT GOES THROUGH THE HATCH, STRAIGHT TO\nTHE BUFFET. I'LL HELP YOU PASS IT.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "FOLDED DISPLAY, ON THE CART, THROUGH THE SIDE\nGATE. PROPER PEG IN. RITA SAYS WHEN.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL BRING THE BOARD THROUGH THE HOUSE ONCE THE\nGUEST QUEUE CLEARS. THEN WE CAN CALL THE TOAST.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "STRAIGHT THROUGH. FRANKIE'S CLEARED THE BUFFET AND\nOPENED THE BOWLS. THERE'S SUPPER.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE COMPLETE. EIGHT TASTING BOWLS. MINE'S ONE OF\nTHEM. BUNNY CAN STOP COUNTING MY SPOONFULS.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THE GUEST QUEUE IS IN THE WAY. THE HATCH PUTS US\nSTRAIGHT OVER THE BUFFET. BACK TO THE KITCHEN.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "PEOPLE USE THE HOUSE DOOR AND REAR ARCH. DINNER\nGOES THROUGH THE HATCH. IF WE CONFUSE THOSE, I'LL\nHAVE TO GARNISH MILO.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "EVEN FOLDED, THE DISPLAY IS WIDER THAN THE HATCH.\nUSE THE SIDE GATE. WE'RE NOT SERVING RITA'S WORK\nIN SLICES.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "DINNER FIRST. HUNGRY PEOPLE LOOK AT CERAMIC BOWLS\nFOR THE WRONG REASON.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "ARE YOU READY TO SHOW EVERYONE YOUR PANEL?",
      "record_id": "P13.CHOICE.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 36,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "YES. BRING IT THROUGH THE SIDE GATE. ONCE IT'S IN\nPLACE, OPEN THE SCREEN. I'D LIKE TO TELL THEM\nABOUT IT MYSELF.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 37,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "FELIX, VIVIAN, PLEASE BRING THE FOLDED DISPLAY\nTHROUGH THE PEGGED SIDE GATE.",
      "record_id": "P13.CHOICE.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 38,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE HELD. FOLDED WIDTH CLEAR. BRINGING IT\nTHROUGH.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "INTO THE MARKED FOOTPRINT. KEEP IT CONCEALED\nBEHIND THE SCREEN.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 41,
      "header_entry": 40,
      "speaker_id": "vivian",
      "speaker_number": 6,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THANK YOU FOR NOTICING THE GATE. EVEN IF I HAD TO\nSAY IT MYSELF.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 42,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 21,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "WAIT UNTIL THE DISPLAY IS IN ITS MARKED PLACE. AT\nPRESENT, WE'D BE UNVEILING THE WALL.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 43,
      "header_entry": 40,
      "speaker_id": "vivian",
      "speaker_number": 6,
      "voice_index": 22,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "OPENING THE VIEWING SIDE. RITA, IT'S YOURS.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 44,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 23,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "I MADE THIS FOR THE HOUSE. THREE DOORS, ONE TABLE.\nI TRIED SEPARATE TABLES. IT LOOKED LONELY.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 45,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 24,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU PUT US IN IT.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 25,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "I PUT ROOM FOR YOU IN IT. YOU CAN DECIDE WHERE TO\nSIT.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 47,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 26,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU MADE ALL THAT?",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 49,
      "header_entry": 48,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 27,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YES. YOU'VE BEEN EATING OFF MY OTHER WORK FOR\nYEARS. I WANTED ONE YOU COULDN'T PUT GRAVY ON.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 50,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 28,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOW COMPLETE. RITA'S PANEL, PRESENTED BY RITA. I\nDIDN'T HAVE TO EXPLAIN A SINGLE THING ON HER\nBEHALF.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 51,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 29,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL TAKE THE BOARD THROUGH THE HOUSE. THE ROUTE'S\nCLEAR NOW.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.007",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 52,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 30,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO MUST GET EVERYONE SEATED FIRST. THEN I CAN\nCARRY THE BOARD THROUGH THE HOUSE. IT'S WIDE\nENOUGH WITHOUT A GUEST ON EACH END.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.006",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 53,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 31,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "EVERYONE, A MOMENT. WE'VE FED YOU AND SHOWN YOU\nRITA'S WORK. NOW LET'S SAY WHAT WE'RE ACTUALLY\nAGREEING TO.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.008",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 54,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 32,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "TOAST. EVERYBODY HERE, BOARD READY. NO ONE HAS TO\nPROMISE ANYTHING THEY DIDN'T AGREE TO.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 55,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 33,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "FOOD FIRST, THEN RITA'S PRESENTATION. THE PROMISES\nWILL KEEP UNTIL WE'VE KEPT THOSE TWO.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.007",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 56,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 34,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT'S IN USE. IF I MOVE IT NOW, SOMEBODY WILL\nSPEND THE REST OF SUPPER HOLDING THEIR BOWL AND\nBEING POLITE ABOUT IT.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.008",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 57,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 35,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "USE THE THREE ROUTES YOU PREPARED, IN SERVE, SHOW,\nTOAST ORDER.",
      "record_id": "P13.HINT.1",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 59,
      "header_entry": 58,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "PEOPLE USE THE HOUSE DOOR. FOOD GOES STRAIGHT\nTHROUGH THE KITCHEN HATCH. THE WIDE DISPLAY NEEDS\nTHE SIDE GATE.",
      "record_id": "P13.HINT.2",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 60,
      "header_entry": 58,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "GIVE MILO THE PROGRAM TO SEAT EVERYONE. PASS THE\nLIDDED POT THROUGH THE HATCH AND PULL SERVE. GET\nRITA'S PERMISSION, SEND THE DISPLAY THROUGH THE",
      "record_id": "P13.HINT.3",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 61,
      "header_entry": 58,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "PEGGED GATE, OPEN THE SCREEN AND PULL SHOW. SEND\nFRANKIE WITH THE BOARD THROUGH THE CLEAR HOUSE,\nUSE THE MICROPHONE, AND PULL TOAST.",
      "record_id": "P13.HINT.3",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 62,
      "header_entry": 58,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "SUPPER HAS BEEN SERVED, RITA HAS PRESENTED HER\nWORK, AND THE BOARD IS HERE. WHO GETS THE\nCEREMONIAL FLOURISH?",
      "record_id": "VC04.ENTRY",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 63,
      "header_entry": 48,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 36,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "A BRIEF HOUSEHOLD-LED TOAST, OR YOUR LIMITED\nINTRODUCTION. THE ACTUAL COMMITMENTS STAY AS\nAGREED.",
      "record_id": "VC04.ENTRY",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 64,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 37,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YES. JUST THE FORM OF THE TOAST. PRACTICE FIRST,\nOR BEGIN?",
      "record_id": "VC04.ENTRY",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 65,
      "header_entry": 48,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 38,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "A REMATCH, ON THE SAME NARROW TERMS. WE CAN\nPRACTICE FIRST.",
      "record_id": "VC04.REMATCH",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 66,
      "header_entry": 48,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 39,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE SUPPER, LET RITA PRESENT HER WORK, AND BRING\nTHE PLEDGE BOARD HERE FIRST.",
      "record_id": "VC04.NOT_READY",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 67,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "COMPLETE ONE CONTEST ATTEMPT WITH MR. STRINGER\nBEFORE THE TOAST IS READY. THE MEAL, PRESENTATION\nAND BOARD DELIVERY REMAIN COMPLETE.",
      "record_id": "VC04.NEED_RESOLUTION",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 68,
      "header_entry": 7,
      "speaker_id": "text",
      "speaker_number": 0,
      "voice_index": 0,
      "audio_module": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "I SAID I COULD BRING EVERYONE TOGETHER. I SHOULD\nHAVE SPECIFIED A DOORWAY.",
      "record_id": "P13.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 1,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 1,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU DID. THE SAME ONE.",
      "record_id": "P13.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 3,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 2,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THREE LOADS. THREE OPENINGS. USE THE CUES.",
      "record_id": "P13.OPEN.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 5,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 3,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "EACH CUE SHOWS THE LOAD, ITS ROUTE AND ANY BLOCKED\nLANE BEFORE WE MOVE. NOBODY GOES UNTIL WE CHOOSE.\nI CAN TAKE A BREATH WITHOUT MISSING DINNER.",
      "record_id": "P13.LOOK.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 6,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 4,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "EIGHT PLACES FOR EIGHT ACTUAL COMMITMENTS. I'VE\nNEVER SEEN A BLANK BOARD LOOK SO MUCH LIKE\nFRANKIE.",
      "record_id": "P13.LOOK.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 19,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 5,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "FRONT DOOR, LIVING ROOM, REAR ARCH. EVERYONE TO\nTHEIR COURTYARD PLACES, THEN I SIT DOWN.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 22,
      "header_entry": 21,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 6,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "NO LITTLE SPEECH IN THE DOORWAY.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 23,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 7,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "MAY I SAY \"THIS WAY\"? I'VE GOT TO LET SOME OF IT\nOUT.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 24,
      "header_entry": 21,
      "speaker_id": "milo",
      "speaker_number": 5,
      "voice_index": 8,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THE LIDDED POT GOES THROUGH THE HATCH, STRAIGHT TO\nTHE BUFFET. I'LL HELP YOU PASS IT.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 25,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 9,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "FOLDED DISPLAY, ON THE CART, THROUGH THE SIDE\nGATE. PROPER PEG IN. RITA SAYS WHEN.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 27,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 10,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL BRING THE BOARD THROUGH THE HOUSE ONCE THE\nGUEST QUEUE CLEARS. THEN WE CAN CALL THE TOAST.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 28,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 11,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "STRAIGHT THROUGH. FRANKIE'S CLEARED THE BUFFET AND\nOPENED THE BOWLS. THERE'S SUPPER.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 29,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 12,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "SERVE COMPLETE. EIGHT TASTING BOWLS. MINE'S ONE OF\nTHEM. BUNNY CAN STOP COUNTING MY SPOONFULS.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 30,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 13,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THE GUEST QUEUE IS IN THE WAY. THE HATCH PUTS US\nSTRAIGHT OVER THE BUFFET. BACK TO THE KITCHEN.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.001",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 31,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 14,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "PEOPLE USE THE HOUSE DOOR AND REAR ARCH. DINNER\nGOES THROUGH THE HATCH. IF WE CONFUSE THOSE, I'LL\nHAVE TO GARNISH MILO.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.002",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 32,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 15,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "EVEN FOLDED, THE DISPLAY IS WIDER THAN THE HATCH.\nUSE THE SIDE GATE. WE'RE NOT SERVING RITA'S WORK\nIN SLICES.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.003",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 33,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 16,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "DINNER FIRST. HUNGRY PEOPLE LOOK AT CERAMIC BOWLS\nFOR THE WRONG REASON.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 35,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 17,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YES. BRING IT THROUGH THE SIDE GATE. ONCE IT'S IN\nPLACE, OPEN THE SCREEN. I'D LIKE TO TELL THEM\nABOUT IT MYSELF.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 37,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 18,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE HELD. FOLDED WIDTH CLEAR. BRINGING IT\nTHROUGH.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 39,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 19,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "INTO THE MARKED FOOTPRINT. KEEP IT CONCEALED\nBEHIND THE SCREEN.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 41,
      "header_entry": 40,
      "speaker_id": "vivian",
      "speaker_number": 6,
      "voice_index": 20,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THANK YOU FOR NOTICING THE GATE. EVEN IF I HAD TO\nSAY IT MYSELF.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.004",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 42,
      "header_entry": 26,
      "speaker_id": "felix",
      "speaker_number": 8,
      "voice_index": 21,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "WAIT UNTIL THE DISPLAY IS IN ITS MARKED PLACE. AT\nPRESENT, WE'D BE UNVEILING THE WALL.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 43,
      "header_entry": 40,
      "speaker_id": "vivian",
      "speaker_number": 6,
      "voice_index": 22,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "OPENING THE VIEWING SIDE. RITA, IT'S YOURS.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 44,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 23,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "I MADE THIS FOR THE HOUSE. THREE DOORS, ONE TABLE.\nI TRIED SEPARATE TABLES. IT LOOKED LONELY.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 45,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 24,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU PUT US IN IT.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 46,
      "header_entry": 2,
      "speaker_id": "bunny",
      "speaker_number": 2,
      "voice_index": 25,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "I PUT ROOM FOR YOU IN IT. YOU CAN DECIDE WHERE TO\nSIT.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 47,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 26,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU MADE ALL THAT?",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 49,
      "header_entry": 48,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 27,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YES. YOU'VE BEEN EATING OFF MY OTHER WORK FOR\nYEARS. I WANTED ONE YOU COULDN'T PUT GRAVY ON.",
      "record_id": "P13.DIALOGUE.005",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 50,
      "header_entry": 34,
      "speaker_id": "rita",
      "speaker_number": 7,
      "voice_index": 28,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "SHOW COMPLETE. RITA'S PANEL, PRESENTED BY RITA. I\nDIDN'T HAVE TO EXPLAIN A SINGLE THING ON HER\nBEHALF.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.006",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 51,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 29,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL TAKE THE BOARD THROUGH THE HOUSE. THE ROUTE'S\nCLEAR NOW.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.007",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 52,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 30,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "MILO MUST GET EVERYONE SEATED FIRST. THEN I CAN\nCARRY THE BOARD THROUGH THE HOUSE. IT'S WIDE\nENOUGH WITHOUT A GUEST ON EACH END.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.006",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 53,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 31,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "EVERYONE, A MOMENT. WE'VE FED YOU AND SHOWN YOU\nRITA'S WORK. NOW LET'S SAY WHAT WE'RE ACTUALLY\nAGREEING TO.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.008",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 54,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 32,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "TOAST. EVERYBODY HERE, BOARD READY. NO ONE HAS TO\nPROMISE ANYTHING THEY DIDN'T AGREE TO.",
      "record_id": "P13.SUCCESS.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 55,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 33,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "FOOD FIRST, THEN RITA'S PRESENTATION. THE PROMISES\nWILL KEEP UNTIL WE'VE KEPT THOSE TWO.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.007",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 56,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 34,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "THAT'S IN USE. IF I MOVE IT NOW, SOMEBODY WILL\nSPEND THE REST OF SUPPER HOLDING THEIR BOWL AND\nBEING POLITE ABOUT IT.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.008",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 57,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 35,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "SUPPER HAS BEEN SERVED, RITA HAS PRESENTED HER\nWORK, AND THE BOARD IS HERE. WHO GETS THE\nCEREMONIAL FLOURISH?",
      "record_id": "VC04.ENTRY",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 63,
      "header_entry": 48,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 36,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "A BRIEF HOUSEHOLD-LED TOAST, OR YOUR LIMITED\nINTRODUCTION. THE ACTUAL COMMITMENTS STAY AS\nAGREED.",
      "record_id": "VC04.ENTRY",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 64,
      "header_entry": 0,
      "speaker_id": "jack",
      "speaker_number": 1,
      "voice_index": 37,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "YES. JUST THE FORM OF THE TOAST. PRACTICE FIRST,\nOR BEGIN?",
      "record_id": "VC04.ENTRY",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 65,
      "header_entry": 48,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 38,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "A REMATCH, ON THE SAME NARROW TERMS. WE CAN\nPRACTICE FIRST.",
      "record_id": "VC04.REMATCH",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 66,
      "header_entry": 48,
      "speaker_id": "stringer",
      "speaker_number": 4,
      "voice_index": 39,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE-TO-HOUSE LANE IS BLOCKED. PUT THE FURNITURE\nBACK ON ITS PLAN MARK BEFORE WE SEND THIS LOAD.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 69,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 40,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "HATCH-SIDE BUFFET POSITION IS BLOCKED. PUT THE\nFURNITURE BACK ON ITS PLAN MARK BEFORE WE SEND\nTHIS LOAD.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 70,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 41,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "DISPLAY ALCOVE IS BLOCKED. PUT THE FURNITURE BACK\nON ITS PLAN MARK BEFORE WE SEND THIS LOAD.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 71,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 42,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "KITCHEN HATCH IS BLOCKED. PUT THE FURNITURE BACK\nON ITS PLAN MARK BEFORE WE SEND THIS LOAD.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 72,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 43,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "GATE-TO-HOUSE LANE IS BLOCKED. PUT THE FURNITURE\nBACK ON ITS PLAN MARK BEFORE WE SEND THIS LOAD.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 69,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 40,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "HATCH-SIDE BUFFET POSITION IS BLOCKED. PUT THE\nFURNITURE BACK ON ITS PLAN MARK BEFORE WE SEND\nTHIS LOAD.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 70,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 41,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "DISPLAY ALCOVE IS BLOCKED. PUT THE FURNITURE BACK\nON ITS PLAN MARK BEFORE WE SEND THIS LOAD.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 71,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 42,
      "audio_module": 925
    },
    {
      "text": "KITCHEN HATCH IS BLOCKED. PUT THE FURNITURE BACK\nON ITS PLAN MARK BEFORE WE SEND THIS LOAD.",
      "record_id": "P13.FAILURE.009",
      "resource": 214,
      "entry": 72,
      "header_entry": 4,
      "speaker_id": "frankie",
      "speaker_number": 3,
      "voice_index": 43,
      "audio_module": 925
    }
  ],
